{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/textb1.png?t=1746813572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/tsgif_gameplay.gif?t=1746813572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twenty Six is an action packed\u00a0bullet hell that you play through the multiverse- <strong>and experience how it was made in parallel dimensions</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/textb2.png?t=1746813572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/tsgif_jump.gif?t=1746813572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dimension changes how the <strong>player</strong> and how the <strong>blocks</strong> work. However, these can be mixed, resulting in 676 different verses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple: Start from <strong>AA</strong> and get to <strong>ZZ</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/versesdemo.png?t=1746813572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/textb4.png?t=1746813572\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the first 5 (of 26) dimensions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through 25 verses in total</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in the &quot;Cruise&quot; mode, exploring every verse one by one</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708120?t=1746813572","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708120?t=1746813572","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/1de99c794565af1a1665d7783aefd7b3c86e9e3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746813572","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/1de99c794565af1a1665d7783aefd7b3c86e9e3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746813572","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/textb1.png?t=1746813572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/tsgif_gameplay.gif?t=1746813572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twenty Six is an action packed\u00a0bullet hell that you play through the multiverse- <strong>and experience how it was made in parallel dimensions</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/textb2.png?t=1746813572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/tsgif_jump.gif?t=1746813572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dimension changes how the <strong>player</strong> and how the <strong>blocks</strong> work. However, these can be mixed, resulting in 676 different verses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple: Start from <strong>AA</strong> and get to <strong>ZZ</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/versesdemo.png?t=1746813572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/extras/textb4.png?t=1746813572\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the first 5 (of 26) dimensions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through 25 verses in total</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in the &quot;Cruise&quot; mode, exploring every verse one by one</p></li></ul>","developers":["teevy"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3638060","name":"Twenty Six"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708120/bb42880e0798b8ccd8c5c29023397dd19931e3cd/header.jpg?t=1746813572","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135213,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135213/movie480.mp4?t=1746813569","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135213/movie_max.mp4?t=1746813569"},"name":"Twenty Six Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135213/0ef2c8fd9c24e58a54001b2cec4cd51a560110f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746813569","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135213/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746813569","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135213/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746813569"}}],"name":"Twenty Six Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":